# Kestrel Ice Ring: a beginner's kart circuit in an ice canyon.
# Units in metres: x east, z south, from the world's north-west corner.
course kestrel size 512 style ice
title KESTREL ICE RING
blurb A kart circuit cut through the ice: a long start straight, a climb over Beacon Hill between walls of blue ice, a hairpin on its shoulder and a dip through the hollow.
race laps 3 rivals 3 vehicle kart
road 12 walls 2.5
land 30 4
hour 13.5

